 r←RefLog(space folder args);branch;value;flag
⍝ Desc: List reference log entries (RefLogs)
⍝ Parse: 1s -max= -all -branch= -project=
⍝ Project: 1
 branch←{(,0)≡,⍵:'' ⋄ ⍵}args.branch
 :If (,0)≡,args.max
     r←folder ##.RefLog(~args.all)branch
 :Else
     r←folder ##.RefLog 0 branch
     (flag value)←⎕VFI args.max
     '"max" must be a positive integer'Assert flag
     r←value↑r
 :EndIf
⍝Done
